#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:6
msgid "Recording video"
msgstr "录制视频"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:10
msgid ""
"This guide shows how to record ``mp4`` clips from a visualizer or a scene "
"sensor during a run."
msgstr "本指南介绍如何在运行过程中，从可视化器或场景传感器录制 ``mp4`` 视频片段。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:21
msgid ""
"Each ``VideoRecorderCfg`` entry is independent: different sources write "
"different files at their own cadence, with no limit on simultaneous "
"recorders."
msgstr "每个 ``VideoRecorderCfg`` 条目独立运行：不同数据源按照各自的录制周期写入不同文件，同时运行的录制器数量没有限制。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:26
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:28
msgid "Add a ``VideoRecorderCfg`` to ``env_cfg.video_recorders``:"
msgstr "在 ``env_cfg.video_recorders`` 中添加 ``VideoRecorderCfg`` ："

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:38
msgid ""
"``source`` also accepts an ``ImageViewCfg``: use "
"``VideoRecorderCfg(source=view)`` to share an image selection and frame with"
" a window. See :ref:`how-to-visualizer-streaming-camera-view` for sensor and"
" perspective examples."
msgstr ""
"``source`` 也接受 ``ImageViewCfg``：使用 "
"``VideoRecorderCfg(source=view)``，可与窗口共享图像选择和帧。传感器与透视视图示例见 :ref:`how-to-"
"visualizer-streaming-camera-view`。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:42
msgid ""
"Or pass ``--video [SOURCE]`` on the command line to record without editing "
"the environment config. ``--video`` adds a single recorder; to record "
"several sources at once, list one ``VideoRecorderCfg`` per source in "
"``env_cfg.video_recorders``, which then takes precedence over the "
"``--video`` source (``--video_length`` and ``--video_interval`` still apply "
"to every recorder):"
msgstr ""
"也可在命令行传入 ``--video [SOURCE]``，无需修改环境配置即可录制。``--video`` 添加一个录制器；若要同时录制多个来源，在 "
"``env_cfg.video_recorders`` 中为每个来源列出一个 ``VideoRecorderCfg``。此列表优先于 "
"``--video`` 的来源设置，但 ``--video_length`` 和 ``--video_interval`` 仍应用于所有录制器："

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:55
msgid ""
"``--video`` records from the source it names, and ``--viz`` still decides "
"which visualizers open a window. See :ref:`the --video sources "
"<record_video_cli>` for every command-line form, and `Sources`_ and `Clip "
"control`_ below for the ``VideoRecorderCfg`` options. To record from a "
"different camera angle than the interactive view, see `Recording from an "
"independent camera angle`_."
msgstr ""
"``--video`` 从指定来源录制，``--viz`` 仍决定哪些可视化器打开窗口。所有命令行形式见 :ref:`--video 来源 "
"<record_video_cli>`，``VideoRecorderCfg`` 选项见下方 `来源 <Sources_>`_ 和 `片段控制 "
"<Clip control_>`_。从不同于交互视图的角度录制，见 `从独立相机视角录制 <Recording from an independent "
"camera angle_>`_。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:81
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:83
msgid ""
"All three examples use the Shadow Hand cube-reorientation task, ``Isaac-"
"Reorient-Cube-Shadow-Camera-Direct``, which ships with a built-in tiled "
"camera sensor. Examples 1 and 2 each demonstrate one recording source; "
"Example 3 combines all four."
msgstr ""
"这三个示例均使用 Shadow Hand 立方体重定向任务 ``Isaac-Reorient-Cube-Shadow-Camera-Direct`` "
"，该任务内置平铺相机传感器。示例 1 和 2 分别演示一种录制来源，示例 3 则组合全部四种来源。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:0
msgid "Code for run_video_recording.py"
msgstr "run_video_recording.py 的代码"

