"将一个视频片段写入 ``videos/recording_tutorial/example_1/kit_viewport_0000.mp4``"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:118
msgid "Example 2: Scene sensor, headless"
msgstr "示例 2：场景传感器，无界面运行"

