"One clip is written to "
"``videos/recording_tutorial/example_2/sensor_0000.mp4``"
msgstr "将一个视频片段写入 ``videos/recording_tutorial/example_2/sensor_0000.mp4``"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:140
msgid ""
"``source=\"sensor:tiled_camera\"`` is the key under which the camera is "
"registered in ``env.scene.sensors``"
msgstr ""
"``source=\"sensor:tiled_camera\"`` 中的 ``tiled_camera`` 是该相机在 "
