msgstr ""
"传感器的 ``data_types`` 必须包含待录制通道；默认通道为 ``rgb``，也支持 ``depth``、``segmentation`` 和"
" ``normals``，见 `数据源 <Sources_>`_"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:152
msgid "Example 3: All sources simultaneously"
msgstr "示例 3：同时录制所有来源"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:159
msgid ""
"Four independent clips are written to "
"``videos/recording_tutorial/example_3/``:"
msgstr "将四个独立的视频片段写入 ``videos/recording_tutorial/example_3/`` ："

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:161
msgid "``kit_viewport_0000.mp4``: Kit interactive viewport (RTX renderer)"
msgstr "``kit_viewport_0000.mp4`` ：Kit 交互视口（RTX 渲染器）"

