#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:300
msgid ""
"The camera angle, resolution, and other visualizer settings are configured "
"on the corresponding visualizer config, not on the recorder. A "
"``viz:<type>`` visualizer that ``--viz`` does not select runs headless, only"
" for the recording, with the settings of its config in "
"``sim.visualizer_cfgs``."
msgstr ""
"相机角度、分辨率及其他可视化设置应在对应的可视化器配置中设置，不在录制器中设置。``--viz`` 未选中的 ``viz:<type>`` "
"可视化器仅为录制而无窗口运行，使用 ``sim.visualizer_cfgs`` 中对应配置的设置。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:304
msgid ""
"``visualizer`` is accepted as the long form of the ``viz`` prefix "
"(``\"visualizer:kit\"`` is ``\"viz:kit\"``). The deprecated ``newton`` type "
"(``\"viz:newton\"``) still works with a warning; use ``newton_gl``. Bare "
"visualizer types are accepted here too, e.g. "
"``VideoRecorderCfg(source=\"newton_gl\")`` is equivalent to "
"``VideoRecorderCfg(source=\"viz:newton_gl\")``."
msgstr ""
"``visualizer`` 可作为 ``viz`` 前缀的完整形式，例如 ``\"visualizer:kit\"`` 等同于 "
"``\"viz:kit\"``。已弃用的 ``newton`` 类型（``\"viz:newton\"``）仍可使用，但会发出警告；请改用 "
"``newton_gl``。这里也接受不带前缀的可视化器类型，例如 ``VideoRecorderCfg(source=\"newton_gl\")``"
" 等同于 ``VideoRecorderCfg(source=\"viz:newton_gl\")``。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:311
msgid ""
"The Newton RTX viewer framebuffer can be recorded with "
"``\"viz:newton_rtx\"``, but recording its streaming view is not supported."
msgstr "可通过 ``\"viz:newton_rtx\"`` 录制 Newton RTX 查看器的帧缓冲区，但不支持录制其流式视图。"

