#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:365
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:367
msgid ""
"``source=\"viz:newton_gl:streaming_view\"`` and "
"``source=\"viz:kit:streaming_view\"`` require ``streaming_view=True`` on the"
" corresponding visualizer cfg.  A :class:`~RuntimeError` is raised when the "
"recorder is constructed if it is not set."
msgstr ""
"``source=\"viz:newton_gl:streaming_view\"`` 和 "
"``source=\"viz:kit:streaming_view\"`` 要求在对应可视化器配置中设置 "
"``streaming_view=True``；否则构造录制器时会抛出 :class:`~RuntimeError`。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:371
msgid ""
"For ``source=\"sensor:<name>\"``, the named sensor must exist on the scene "
"config with the recorded channel (``\"rgb\"`` by default) in its "
"``data_types``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``source=\"sensor:<name>\"`` 时，场景配置中必须存在该名称的传感器，其 ``data_types`` "
"必须包含待录制通道，默认通道为 ``\"rgb\"``。"

