#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:383
msgid ""
"Launches Isaac Sim; the launch enables camera rendering for the recording."
msgstr "启动 Isaac Sim，并在启动时为录制启用相机渲染。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:384
msgid "``newton_gl``"
msgstr "``newton_gl``"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:386
msgid ""
"Uses pyglet's EGL backend when headless; the default for ``--video`` without"
" a capture-capable ``--viz``."
msgstr "无窗口时使用 pyglet 的 EGL 后端；这是 ``--video`` 在未选择支持捕获的 ``--viz`` 时的默认来源。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:388
msgid "``newton_rtx``"
msgstr "``newton_rtx``"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:390
msgid ""
"Starts the OVRTX runtime; capture performs a GPU-to-CPU readback of the "
"path-traced framebuffer."
msgstr "启动 OVRTX 运行时；捕获帧时，将路径追踪帧缓冲区从 GPU 回读到 CPU。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:392
msgid "``rerun``"
msgstr "``rerun``"

