msgid "✗"
msgstr "✗"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:394
msgid ""
"Remote streaming tool; no local frame-capture API. ``viz:rerun`` is an "
"error; ``--video --viz rerun`` records from a headless ``newton_gl``."
msgstr ""
"远程流式工具，无本地帧捕获 API。``viz:rerun`` 会报错；``--video --viz rerun`` 则从无窗口 "
"``newton_gl`` 录制。"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:396
msgid "``viser``"
msgstr "``viser``"

#: source/how-to/record_video.rst:398
