"Browser streaming tool; no local frame-capture API. ``viz:viser`` is an "
"error; ``--video --viz viser`` records from a headless ``newton_gl``."
msgstr ""
"浏览器流式工具，无本地帧捕获 API。``viz:viser`` 会报错；``--video --viz viser`` 则从无窗口 "
"``newton_gl`` 录制。"

